msgid "**Reference:** M.G. Stabin and M.W. Konijnenberg, *Re-evaluation of absorbed fractions for photons and electrons in spheres of various sizes*, J Nucl Med 2000;41:149–160, Tables 2 and 3. Unit-density spheres with a uniform monoenergetic photon source, inside an infinite unit-density medium. The recommended values are the mean of EGS4 and MCNP4B."
msgstr "**Referência:** M.G. Stabin e M.W. Konijnenberg, *Re-evaluation of absorbed fractions for photons and electrons in spheres of various sizes*, J Nucl Med 2000;41:149–160, Tabelas 2 e 3. Esferas de densidade 1 com uma fonte de fótons monoenergética uniforme, dentro de um meio infinito de densidade 1. Os valores recomendados são a média de EGS4 e MCNP4B."

msgid "The 231 values (21 masses from 1 to 6000 g; 12 energies from 20 keV to 2.75 MeV) are in `validation/stabin2000_photons.csv`. Rows garbled by the text extraction of the PDF were transcribed from the page images, and every row was checked in two ways: the radius matches unit density, and the recommended value is the EGS4/MCNP mean."
msgstr "Os 231 valores (21 massas de 1 a 6000 g; 12 energias de 20 keV a 2,75 MeV) estão em `validation/stabin2000_photons.csv`. As linhas embaralhadas na extração do texto do PDF foram transcritas das imagens das páginas, e cada linha foi conferida de duas formas: o raio corresponde a densidade 1, e o valor recomendado é a média EGS4/MCNP."

